// assets/data/nearest_stars.ron
//
// Multi-star ephemeris catalog for inter-system transfer math.
// Source of truth: GRA-332 LGD design contract.
// Each entry is one star system; multi-star entries use the system
// barycenter (mass-weighted mean) position and velocity. Modders edit
// this file by hand; the loader picks up new entries without a Rust
// recompile (see docs/MODDING.md -> "Multi-Star Ephemeris").
//
// Coordinate frame: Galactic Cartesian J2000 (ly) for position, km/s
// for velocity. Epoch is game-start (SimulationTime anchor 0.0); see
// src/astronomy/star_epoch.rs::EPOCH_BEACON_GAME_START_SIM_S.
//
// mass_sol is the total stellar mass of the system in solar masses.
// The runtime derives mu_m3_s2 = mass_sol * GM_SUN at load time; do not
// pre-compute it here.
//
// velocity_kms defaults to (0.0, 0.0, 0.0) for systems without published
// Gaia DR3 proper motions (linear extrapolation is the v0.6 contract;
// proper-motion second-order terms are a v1.0 follow-up).

